    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/extras/4e8d57fdab7bf70387f6090cbfe46bb6.avif?t=1746029511\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/extras/34d13bea4bb7af4fc566dbc74fa6d676.poster.avif?t=1746029511\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/extras/34d13bea4bb7af4fc566dbc74fa6d676.webm?t=1746029511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/extras/34d13bea4bb7af4fc566dbc74fa6d676.mp4?t=1746029511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/extras/b4d3a721bb809f399b93ddd0dcf24b11.avif?t=1746029511\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down time in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a variety of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dynamic bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out a wide range of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tons of unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent skills in a long-term progression tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and grow stronger (Resets after each run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between multiple game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good performance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797670/ext